[offset:1000]
[00:01.725] Doha
[00:08.091] Sri guru charana saroja raja nijamana mukura sudhaari ।
[00:23.917] Varanaou raghubara vimalayasha jo daayaka phalachaari ॥
[00:40.857] Buddhiheena tanujaanikai sumirou pavana kumara ।
[00:56.446] Bala buddhi vidyaa dehu mohi harahu kalesha vikaara ॥
[01:13.237]
[01:13.659] Chaupai
[01:16.259] Jaya Hanumaan jnaana guna saagara ।
[01:20.642] Jaya kapisha tihu loka ujaagara ॥ 1 ॥
[01:25.135] Raamaduta atulita baladhaamaa ।
[01:29.615] Anjani putra pavanasuta naamaa ॥ 2 ॥
[01:34.219] Mahaaveera vikrama bajarangii ।
[01:38.830] Kumati nivaar sumati ke sangii ॥ 3 ॥
[01:43.389] Kanchana varana viraaja suvesha ।
[01:48.098] Kaanana kundala kunchita kesha ॥ 4 ॥
[01:52.715] Haathavajra au dhvaja viraajai । [Aur]
[01:57.117] Kaanthe moonja janevuu saajai ॥ 5 ॥
[02:01.754] Shankara suvana kesari nandana । [Shankara swayam]
[02:06.359] Teja prataapa mahaajaga vandana ॥ 6 ॥
[02:10.983] Vidyaavaan gunee ati chatura ।
[02:15.530] Raama kaaja karive ko aatura ॥ 7 ॥
[02:20.128] Prabhu charitra sunive ko rasiya ।
[02:24.681] Raamalakhana seetaa mana basiya ॥ 8 ॥
[02:47.601] Sookshma roopadhari siyahi dikhaavaa ।
[02:52.112] Vikata roopadhari lanka jalaavaa ॥ 9 ॥
[02:56.651] Bheema roopadhari asura samhaare ।
[03:01.186] Raamachandra ke kaaja samvaare ॥ 10 ॥
[03:05.861] Laaya sanjeevana lakhana jiyaaye ।
[03:10.362] Shree raghaveera harashi uralaaye ॥ 11 ॥
[03:14.926] Raghupati keenhee bahuta badaayee (ee) ।
[03:19.603] Tuma mama priya bharata sama bhaayee ॥ 12 ॥
[03:24.191] Sahasra vadana tumharo yashagaavai ।
[03:28.667] Asa kahi shreepati kantha lagaavai ॥ 13 ॥
[03:35.672] Sanakaadik brahmaadi muneesha ।
[03:40.137] Naarada shaarada sahita aheesha ॥ 14 ॥
[03:44.777] Yama kubera digapaala jahaa te ।
[03:49.295] Kavi kovida kahi sake kahaa te ॥ 15 ॥
[03:53.844] Tuma upakaara sugreevahi keenhaa ।
[03:58.429] Raama milaaya raajapada deenha ॥ 16 ॥
[04:21.364] Tumharo mantra vibheeshana maana ।
[04:25.840] Lankeshvara bhaye saba jaga jaana ॥ 17 ॥
[04:30.442] Yuga sahasra yojana para bhaanu ।
[04:34.977] Leelyo taahi madhura phala jaanu ॥ 18 ॥
[04:39.651] Prabhu mudrikaa meeli mukha maahi ।
[04:44.141] Jaladhi laanghi gaye acharaja naahi ॥ 19 ॥
[04:48.599] Durgama kaaja jagata ke jete ।
[04:53.299] Sugama anugraha tumhare tete ॥ 20 ॥
[04:57.868] Raama duaare tuma rakhavaare ।
[05:02.403] Hota na aajnaa binu paisaare ॥ 21 ॥
[05:06.945] Saba sukha lahai tumhaari sharanaa ।
[05:11.600] Tuma rakshaka kaahoo ko dara naa ॥ 22 ॥
[05:16.220] Aapana teja samhaaro aapai ।
[05:20.693] Teeno loka haanka te kaampai ॥ 23 ॥
[05:25.189] Bhoota pishaacha nikata nahi aavai ।
[05:29.792] Mahaveera jaba naama sunaavai ॥ 24 ॥
[05:52.782] Naasai roga harai saba peeraa ।
[05:57.336] Japata nirantara hanumata veeraa ॥ 25 ॥
[06:01.879] Sankata se Hanumaan chhudaavai ।
[06:06.467] Mana krama vachana dhyaana jo laavai ॥ 26 ॥
[06:10.842] Saba para Raama tapasvee raajaa ।
[06:15.549] Tinake kaaja sakala tuma saajaa ॥ 27 ॥
[06:20.091] Aura manoratha jo koi laavai ।
[06:24.622] Taasu amita jeevana phala paavai ॥ 28 ॥
[06:29.261] Chaaro yuga prataapa tumhaaraa ।
[06:34.105] Hai prasiddha jagata ujiyaaraa ॥ 29 ॥
[06:38.326] Saadhu santa ke tuma rakhavaare ।
[06:43.018] Asura nikandana Raama dulaare ॥ 30 ॥
[06:47.550] Ashtasiddhi nava nidhi ke daataa ।
[06:52.173] Asa vara deenha Jaanakee maataa ॥ 31 ॥
[06:56.745] Raama rasaayana tumhaare paasaa ।
[07:01.370] Sadaa raho Raghupati ke daasaa ॥ 32 ॥ [Saadara ho]
[07:05.805] Repeat
[07:06.088] Ashtasiddhi nava nidhi ke daataa ।
[07:10.316] Asa vara deenha Jaanakee maataa ॥ 31 ॥
[07:15.000] Raama rasaayana tumhaare paasaa ।
[07:19.530] Sadaa raho Raghupati ke daasaa ॥ 32 ॥ [Saadara ho]
[07:42.567] Tumhare bhajana Raamako paavai ।
[07:46.951] Janma janma ke dukha bisaraavai ॥ 33 ॥
[07:51.564] Anta kaala Raghupati purajaayee । [Raghuvara]
[07:56.103] Jahaa janma Haribhakta kahaayee ॥ 34 ॥
[08:00.705] Aura devataa chitta na dharayee ।
[08:05.233] Hanumata seyi sarva sukha karayee ॥ 35 ॥
[08:09.848] Sankata katai mitai saba peeraa ।
[08:14.452] Jo sumirai Hanumata bala veeraa ॥ 36 ॥
[08:18.982] Jai jai jai Hanumaan gosaaee ।
[08:28.111] Kripaa karahu gurudeva kee naayee ॥ 37 ॥
[08:32.804] Yaha shata vaara paatha kara koyee । [Jo]
[08:37.338] Chhootahi bandi mahaa sukha hoyee ॥ 38 ॥
[08:42.021] Jo yaha padhe Hanumaan chaaleesaa ।
[08:46.419] Hoya siddhi saakhee Gaurishaa ॥ 39 ॥
[08:50.990] Tulasidaasa sadaa Hari cheraa ।
[08:55.624] Keejai Naatha hridaya maha deraa ॥ 40 ॥
[09:04.766]
Pavana tanaya sankata harana - mangala moorati roop ।
Raama lakhana seetaa sahita - hridaya basahu surabhoopa ॥